"""Process Design units 4-9: the FE Chemical spec items nothing in the Library answered. Particle technology (11.A-C),
plant documents and design practice (14.A, 14.B, 14.D, 14.E), relief and loss prevention (16.D-F), professional
practice (17.A-D, on the NSPE Code read in full), measurement and uncertainty (1.F, 13.C, 13.D) and statistics in
engineering units (2.B-2.F). Two question types per objective; every number recomputed by the verifier.

Where a published table was not read (API relief coefficients, AACE accuracy bands, OSHA thresholds) the card prints
the value it needs, as the ASHRAE items do. Ethics cards state a situation and ask which duty governs; nothing of the
NSPE Code's wording is reproduced.
"""
from opl_dsl import Q

