 ("PD-4.1.B", [FE + "11.A"], "Compute the Sauter mean diameter of a stated size distribution", "The Sauter mean is the diameter of the uniform sphere set with the same surface area per unit volume as the real powder: the sum of n_i d_i cubed over the sum of n_i d_i squared.", "P1"),
