     ("A dimensional standard for flanges exists so that:", "Parts from different makers interchange", "Costs are fixed", "Codes can be avoided", "Inspection is unnecessary"),
     ("A vessel's wall thickness is:", "Set by the code's rules for the design pressure and temperature, not purely by the designer", "A free choice", "Set by the purchaser", "Set by the insurer alone"),
