     ("An engineer's judgment on a safety matter is overridden by a supervisor. The Code's route is to:", "Notify the employer and, where the danger persists, such other authority as may be appropriate", "Comply, since the supervisor is senior", "Resign quietly", "Say nothing until an incident occurs"),
